269

DISPLAY OF VETERANS’ SERVICES INFORMATIONAL POSTERS

Labor Law, Article 7, Section 201-h

1. The department [of labor] shall consult with the department of veterans’ services to create and distribute a veterans’ benefits and services poster. 2. Such poster shall, at a minimum, include information regarding the following services available to veterans:

a. contact and website information for the department of veterans’ services and the department of labor’s veterans’ program;

b. substance abuse and mental health treatment;

c. educational, workforce, and training resources;

d. tax benefits;

e. New York state veteran drivers’ licenses and non-driver identification cards;
